       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the labeled maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day, and it carries a high risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nHere are some options within the labeled limits:\n- **Ibuprofen 800 mg PO four times daily.** This is 3,200 mg/day, the maximum.\n- **Ibuprofen 600 mg PO four times daily.** This is 2,400 mg/day.\n- **Ibuprofen 400 mg PO four times daily.** This is 1,600 mg/day.\n\nTypical dosing is 400\u2013800 mg every 6\u20138 hours, using the lowest effective dose for the shortest time.\n\nYou may have meant 1600 mg as the total daily dose, for example 400 mg four times daily. Tell me which regimen you want, and I'll enter it. I can also add a note, such as \"give with food.\""
